      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Looks like someone doesn't know what for 2FA is made for or at least doesn't know what it can be used for.\nIf user has circumvent bans with new account, it just take a minute to add 2FA to that and then we have one totally useless rank. No thanks.\nCase would be totally different if VRChat would use any custom 2FA system that requires eg. own mobile app (which will check phone hardware id) or hardware key, but with this current software based solution this feature is totally useless.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
