  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-06-29T03:28:03.397Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This should help users filter out malicious users who create accounts to circumvent bans. An account without 2FA should be less trusted by users. \n\nWhile the specifics should be determined internally (limit ranking for non-2FA accounts? add an extra ranking below Visitor/above Trusted? Add a checkbox? Instant bump to User?) it should probably play a role.",
